{"alias":"/literacy/literacyforme/guidance","title":"Guidance for Local Plan Development","changed":"2026-04-06T22:58:24+00:00","before":"<p><br>\r\n<strong>Birth-Age 5 Components</strong><br>\r\nResources to build an early childhood system of development.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"34db20c8-9a95-4ad3-b47d-f27eff376d54\" filename=\"Literacy - Birth-5 Local Level Matrix for Comprehensive Literacy Planning - 3.21.2021.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Literacy%20-%20Birth-5%20Local%20Level%20Matrix%20for%20Comprehensive%20Literacy%20Planning%20-%203.21.2021.pdf\">Birth - Age 5 Local Matrix</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Plan Development</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Grades K-3 Components</strong><br>\r\nResources to support elementary literacy development.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"26da08fd-58c5-455c-bfb7-36a611ca18cb\" filename=\"Grades K-3 Local Matrix.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Grades%20K-3%20Local%20Matrix.pdf\">Grades Kindergarten through 3 Local Matrix</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"5b826a42-6d88-4554-9893-bd124c92e9a8\" filename=\"Grades K-3 Local Plan Development.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Grades%20K-3%20Local%20Plan%20Development.pdf\">Plan Development</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Grades 4-8 Components</strong><br>\r\nResources to support adolescent literacy development.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ce91da3b-dc7b-4e74-b77a-0cc602c6e377\" filename=\"Grades 4-8 Local Matrix.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Grades%204-8%20Local%2